text","text":"spaces (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"),  sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and borders (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BlueCoatThemeTagComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"BlueCoatThemeTagComponentTokensProvider","url":"\/documentation\/misothemesmisobluecoat\/bluecoatthemetagcomponenttokensprovider","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat/documentation/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat\/documentation\/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat","abstract":[{"text":"This BlueCoat theme is a blue theme, quite smooth and simple.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Theme BlueCoat","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/misothemesmisobluecoat","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_bluecoat.png"}],"role":"collection"},"ic_theme_bluecoat.png":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat\/ic_theme_bluecoat.png"}],"type":"image","alt":null,"identifier":"ic_theme_bluecoat.png"},"doc://MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat/documentation/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat/DefaultTagComponentTokensProvider":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat\/documentation\/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat\/DefaultTagComponentTokensProvider","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DefaultTagComponentTokensProvider"}],"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BlueCoat"},{"type":"text","text":" can be considered as default theme for MISO"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DefaultTagComponentTokensProvider"}],"title":"DefaultTagComponentTokensProvider","url":"\/documentation\/misothemesmisobluecoat\/defaulttagcomponenttokens